        "content": {
          "format": "source-lines",
          "lines": [
            "1. Nrim mei paeng thang Aguangh ramgai ta",
            "Lumma phang e ai tingmik thui,",
            "Alung neihla khou lu rui thuan e.",
            "",
            "Himdaimei guang ta dinghuam lana",
            "Banchra guai thuan bam e,",
            "Ai ni aguang ta thuan e",
            "Du kanmei kandi khou rui.",
            "",
            "2. Mik rui hou makmei nu rui chu makmei",
            "Lung rui ningpat mak mei ram gai",
            "Kata nzian mei guai khang pou rui",
            "Chamdan lou the.",
            "",
            "3. Ai ning thukge kandi ching ru khang suang",
            "He lauziuna nang ramgai tei",
            "Kao lev kandih duipui rui thuan e",
            "Thanmei nun Guangh.",
            "",
            " Pastor Abui"
          ]
        }
      }
